{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>ShopFront</strong></i> is a fast paced top down twin stick action arcade-like game set in a fantasy world full of heroes thirsty for more <i><strong>Gems</strong></i> to line their pockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <i><strong>Keeper</strong></i>, an elderly shop keeper with a poor temper fed up with all the heroes destroying his pottery and decides to take matters into his own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/steamdescription_keeeper.gif?t=1744237536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Defeat</i></strong> thousands of Heroes with your broom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Destroy</i></strong> 3+ Bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Collect</i></strong> Gems and go <i><strong>GEMHIGH</strong></i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Explore</i></strong> and triumph over 3+ areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Master</i></strong> the twin stick fast paced broom gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/shopfront_montage.gif?t=1744237536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>PROTECT. YOUR.</i></strong><i> <strong>POT</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3495840?t=1744237536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/be9349250ddde4f4a0aef03ae697b19ef310c4e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744237536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/a0f4f817f5ab47ed761b46514933faa191212cec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744237536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/a0f4f817f5ab47ed761b46514933faa191212cec/capsule_184x6